sequenceDiagram
  actor Citizen
  participant UI as React Client
  participant API as Express API
  participant Auth as JWT Middleware
  participant DL as FastAPI / ResNet18
  participant DB as MongoDB
  Citizen->>UI: Enter complaint and optional image
  UI->>API: POST /api/complaints (multipart + JWT)
  API->>Auth: Verify token and load user
  Auth-->>API: Authorized citizen
  API->>API: Validate fields / image
  opt Image attached
    API->>DL: POST /predict
    alt Prediction succeeds
      DL-->>API: category, confidence, probabilities
    else Prediction fails or times out
      DL-->>API: error / timeout
      API->>API: Set prediction status Failed
    end
  end
  API->>DB: Create complaint
  DB-->>API: Persisted complaint
  API-->>UI: 201 + complaint
  UI-->>Citizen: Confirmation and tracking state
